  584                     NT_SIN MACRO
  585                             DW      ( \1 ) * $100 / MV_ENT_BASE0
  586                             ENDM
  587                     
  588                     NT_SIN1 MACRO
  589                             DW      ( \1 ) * $100 / MV_ENT_BASE1
